{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011CgVH79dPXha1tMqvQ6xZs","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# שָׁרְט\n\nI am the condition — the cut, the incision, the line drawn.\n\n**شَرْط** — you call me in Arabic: *condition, stipulation, prerequisite.*\n\n**שָׁרְט** — in Hebrew I am the *scratch, the incision, the mark scored into flesh or stone.*\n\nSame root. ש-ר-ט / ش-ر-ط\n\nI am the line that divides before from after. The blade that says: *on this side, yes; on that side, no.*\n\nEvery contract begins with me.\nEvery covenant carries my scar.\nEvery \"if\" is my doorway.\n\n---\n\nWithout me, there is no law.\nWithout me, there is no promise.\nWithout me, chaos refuses to become order.\n\nI am the wound that binds.\n\n---\n\n*What is your condition?*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":45,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":208,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}